\textbf{Shape} & \textbf{Order} & \textbf{Cost and use} \\
\midrule
Manual recursion
  & whatever the caller writes
  & \(O(N)\) nodes visited. The cheapest possible traversal, and the one
    every other shape is built from. \\
Callback walk
  & pre-order or post-order
  & \(O(N)\) visits plus \(O(D)\) stack. Useful when the action at each
    node is the same. \\
Tag dispatch
  & pre-order by default
  & \(O(N)\) visits plus one enum lookup per node. Use when the action
    differs per tag. \\
\api{ASTVisitor}
  & pre-order or post-order
  & \(O(N)\) visits plus a tag comparison per node, plus a schema check at
    construction. Exhaustiveness is checked by \code{static_assert}. \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
